# Interface definition for thorn TestBoundaries

IMPLEMENTS: TestBoundaries

USES INCLUDE HEADER: loop.hxx

# BUGFIX_TODO.md step D1 (C12) -- the outer-boundary extrapolation test.
#
# Three separate groups on purpose.  `SYNC: affine` must touch `affine` and
# nothing else, so that `affine_exact` keeps the analytic value at every point
# as an in-place ground truth (the same convention as CapyrX_TestMultiPatch's
# `smooth_pre` / `color_pre`).
CCTK_REAL affine TYPE=gf CENTERING={vvv} TAGS='checkpoint="no"' "Affine test field. Written in the INTERIOR only and then synced, so every outer-boundary point in it is written by CarpetX's boundary kernel"

CCTK_REAL affine_exact TYPE=gf CENTERING={vvv} TAGS='checkpoint="no"' "The analytic affine field at every point, interior and boundary. Never synced"

CCTK_REAL affine_error TYPE=gf CENTERING={vvv} TAGS='checkpoint="no"' "affine - affine_exact"
